    "detailed_description": "A fascinating visual novel in a Russian setting!<br><br>The life of the protagonist, Roma Belov, is turned upside down when he meets a mysterious girl who turns out to be a real alien! The game features three unique stories:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135440/extras/7dad4b690e5dcdeed862054a07cbbbed.avif?t=1739299897\" /></div><br>- Yana's story will tell you about a secret collaboration between Earth and an alien civilisation. And, of course, that all alien species are submissive to love.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135440/extras/b2b16bb9f81f1a6e7526aaa5ebc8f913.avif?t=1739299897\" /></div><br>- Stasya's story is filled with the spirit of adventure and adventurism. You will be able to build a relationship with the beautiful young athlete! Or maybe cooperate with a secret alien control organization?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135440/extras/d6c9200372b529a05e2e7d0c87c4d4cc.avif?t=1739299897\" /></div><br>- Kristina's story will tell you about the background behind the charming class monitor' emerald eyes.<br><br>Episode 1 is available! It takes you through the first six days of the game.<br>Further episodes are in development!<br><br><strong>Features (first episode):</strong><br>- A compelling story from the writer of the &quot;Buns, Kefir and Rock and Roll&quot; mod (the highest-rated Endless Summer mod of all time, over 100,000 subscribers on Steam), balancing humour, drama, adventure and light fanservice;<br>- 150 colourful illustrations from the artist of games such as &quot;Wet steps&quot;, &quot;Moe Era&quot; and &quot;Herbalist&quot;;<br>- Over a hundred music tracks, including original compositions by Leety and Pazetic Ocean;<br>- More than 15 hours of unhurried reading;",
